# Cursor Project Rules

- Read MASTER_PROJECT_PLAN.md first.
- Follow AGENTS.md and AI_TOOLING_GUIDE.md.
- Do not restart from zero.
- Do not skip Spec Kit.
- Do not implement before tasks exist.
- Do not add Playable Vertical Slice Rule.
- Do not add strict deadlines.
- Do not add fixed branch limits.
- Keep all player-facing UI text localizable.
- Respect Arabic RTL and English LTR.
- Update progress, trace, decisions, and checkpoints after meaningful work.
